      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0110_dragonbb_18",
      "hash64": "23AA639E05CCA822",
      "text": "我正在邀請[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她\\n來參加藍莓聯盟喔～！[VAR 0x0114(004A)]",
